 {"file_name": "/tmp/NEtpnb", "id": "2905966889423196", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031569_2905966892756529_491074526126276608_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fB8QG-vmDx0Q7kNvwHJGbiZ&_nc_oc=AdqmuBaWcFb9mn5i7aQD3psPqHrq0E2UocQUFNkw1pgj-Mwiu1SzRenWZS7hNQnDdd4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQxfEF7QaFPUHtY6J-FuX0Sy2R8tCcrXU9He4WKmsRCxA&oe=6AFC6251"}, "display_name": "Epic Fun", "keywords": ["roller", "coaster", "shooter", "park", "free"], "long_description": "Epic Fun is a collection of theme park-inspired attractions.\n\nRoller coasters are our main attractions! There are six in total and each one has a unique theme and comes with an exclusive rail shooting game!\n\nBe sure to test your fear of heights in our freefall tower, and take a leisurely ride on our event-filled ferris wheel.\n\nCompete for the best position in the different rankings of each of the three games: Shooting, Dart and Hammer.\n\nTry a roller coaster, a moving shooting game, a free fall tower and a sledgehammer game for free.", "short_description": "Epic Fun is a VR Theme Park based attractionsEpic Fun is a collection of theme park-inspired attractions.\n\nRoller coasters are our main attractions! There are six in total and each one has a unique theme and comes with an exclusive rail shooting game!\n\nBe sure to test your fear of heights in our freefall tower, and take a leisurely ride on our event-filled ferris wheel.\n\nCompete for the best position in the different rankings of each of the three games: Shooting, Dart and Hammer."}]}, "developer_name": "B4T Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://b4t.games/pp", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://b4t.games/tos", "publisher_name": "B4T Games", "support_website_url": "http://fb.me/b4t.games", "website_url": "http://b4t.games/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_